  "notes": {
    "made": "--init (frames, waist, below), then by hand (round 3: 「后面的英雄都按这个思路来 先去联盟客户端找英雄的特色是什么 再做run的动画」): lock head - her drawn run (Codex's whole-frame redraw, casts_leona_hd.py) redraws the upper body every frame, so only the head is one drawing (Ezreal v2's way); the long back hair, the shield, the sword, the arms and the legs stay each frame's own drawing",
    "head": "frame 4's sun crown, hair cap with the front lock and face (3/4 to the right as in every frame; the closest to her idle of the heads that fit: colour-IoU 0.39 against hd_idle_base[0]); the drawn heads are 8 drawings (IoU 0.37-0.58 between them: the crown's spikes, the eyes small or big and the lock redrawn every frame). Frames 2, 3, 5, 6 draw the head a row taller (crown tip to jaw 22 rows, the others 21): laid on a 21-row frame its tip would leave the frame, so frame 4's (21 rows, the frames' own sizes kept)",
    "chin": "frame 4's first row under the jaw's outline",
    "bob": "the drawn one (the head where each frame drew its own: the face on the face, the jaw on the drawn jaw)",
    "waist": "--init's (not used by the head lock)",
    "keep_one": "her 1x run is the installed one (ppu_one's from the dense frames differs in 80 squares even in the untouched frame 4): it stays as installed (assets/source/leona/hd/leona_run_one.png, from 33c4a229b), only hd_run and lo_run are made",
    "variants": "char: head_match_colours = her skin (the columns: the face), chin_rows = each frame's jaw row (the lowest skin row of the face's right part) with head_align chin (the rows); clear_all; clear_poly: the clearing stops above row 17 left of the face (the pauldron and the hair strand on it stay square for square); beside_head front: what the drawn heads leave in front of the face is ground, behind it (the back of the head, where the long hair runs on into it) the gap is filled from the hair; fill_skip: her skin, the armour's golds / creams / magentas are never filled in (a frame's longer front lock leaves a gap by the collar: hair or outline, not the collar's gold)",
    "undecided": []
  }
